@startuml
title StorageRoute to Relational Access - Future Bridge

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor "Business Service" as Service
participant "StorageRouteContext" as Context
participant "IdempotencyStorage" as Idem
participant "StorageRouteToSqlRouteBridge" as Bridge
participant "RelationalTemplate" as Template
participant "RoutingDataSourceResolver" as Resolver
database "order-db-1" as DB1

Service -> Context : open(idempotencyRoute)
Service -> Idem : markSuccess(idempotencyKey)

Idem -> Context : current()
Context --> Idem : StorageRoute(logicalTable=iron_idempotency_record,\nphysicalLocation=order-db-1.iron_idempotency_record_017)

Idem -> Bridge : toSqlRoute(StorageRoute)
Bridge --> Idem : SqlRoute(dataSourceKey=order-db-1)

Idem -> Template : update(SqlStatement.withRoute(SqlRoute))
Template -> Resolver : resolve(order-db-1)
Resolver --> Template : DataSource(order-db-1)
Template -> DB1 : INSERT / UPDATE technical record

note right of Bridge
The bridge belongs to an integration module,
not to relational-api.
Relational Access should not depend on Storage Routing.
The route must already refer to the idempotency table;
an order table location cannot be reused as-is.
end note

@enduml
